### Agent specification ###
.claude/

# terraform provider binaries, downloaded by `terraform init` - never committed (the google provider
# alone is 125 MB, which GitHub refuses outright). The lock file beside them IS committed: it pins the
# provider versions a template was validated against.
.terraform/
